PlayerModelChanger-RE
=====================

PlayerModelChanger-RE is a modified version of CS2-PlayerModelChanger:

  Original project: https://github.com/samyycX/CS2-PlayerModelChanger
  Original project Copyright (C) samyycX and contributors.

This repository is maintained by the PlayerModelChanger-RE contributors.

Modifications
-------------
This version contains changes made on 2026-10-29 and earlier, including:

- renamed the plugin, plugin directory and configuration to PlayerModelChanger-RE;
- Panorama-style menus and a restored side-selection menu;
- custom meshgroup families and automatic meshgroup catalogue generation from
  configured workshop VPKs;
- improved model preview (inspection camera);
- model preview and meshgroup menu behavior fixes;
- bot model stability fixes: a stable model per bot per map, and bot model
  changes deferred until the next map after a plugin reload;
- the stable model of a bot is not tied to its team: a bot that changes sides
  keeps the model it picked on its first spawn, instead of rolling a new one at
  the team switch (bot models are still chosen from the ModelForBots list of the
  side the bot first spawned on);
- documentation, build output and tooling changes.

The original copyright notices and attribution must be preserved when this work
is redistributed.

