Third-party components
----------------------
The release packages contain third-party libraries and tools, including Dapper,
SkiaSharp, Microsoft.Data.Sqlite/SQLitePCLRaw/e_sqlite3, MySqlConnector,
Newtonsoft.Json and Microsoft.Extensions.* dependencies. The packages with
"S2V-CLI" in their name also contain Source2Viewer-CLI.

